      "description": "The frozen claim claims/bounded-method-label.json (key 196346d46d4d81fb) on the task's pinned closure, by jvmcontract's own checker under strict gaps, as the task states it: no wrapper and no narrower subject. Until this change the task was refused before any proof (input-construction:interface-parameter, VF-027), because WebMvcTags#method takes a javax.servlet.http.HttpServletRequest. jvmcontract now gives a parameter of an interface type an implementation of the accessors the target calls (here getMethod(), any String of up to 8 code units), reads the Tag result through getKey() and getValue() with Strings compared by content, and runs HttpMethod's map of names through a HashMap model. This run is the gap packet's closure test: the unchanged claim on the same artifacts. Spring Boot 2.7.18 resolves the method through HttpMethod; expected established for every request of the stated domain, null included.",
